WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,830
well done

2
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:02,720
You have made great contributions to our factory

3
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:03,800
These ten thousand kilograms of grain

4
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:05,120
Not only stabilized the canteen

5
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,800
It also stabilized the hearts of all factory workers.

6
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,520
Factory Director Secretary: It’s serious.

7
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:09,840
This is my job

8
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:11,320
It was also Section Chief Gao who gave me support.

9
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:13,360
Only then do I have a chance to get the food back

10
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:15,360
The main thing is that Brother Qin is capable

11
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:18,320
I just help with coordination.

12
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:20,200
Your purchasing department did a great job this time.

13
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:25,300
Go to the office and say

14
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,620
Comrade Qin Tian

15
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:28,740
Getting so much food in such a short time

16
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:31,800
how did you do it

17
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:34,680
After Section Chief Gao told me about the difficulties in the factory,

18
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:37,360
I contacted everyone I could contact.

19
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:39,120
It’s really hard to get food now

20
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:41,700
Many people can't take care of themselves

21
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:42,780
Specific channels

22
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:44,540
It’s not that I don’t believe in the leaders

23
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:45,780
But once the news leaks out,

24
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:47,220
All other units are paved over

25
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:50,960
If our factory wants to get grain in the future, we will have no chance.

26
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:53,120
I told Section Chief Gao about this channel before.

27
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:54,120
must be kept confidential

28
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:55,840
Can we get food at this time?

29
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:57,040
Not only do you have to be capable

30
00:00:57,040 --> 00:00:58,880
You also have to have courage and responsibility

31
00:00:58,880 --> 00:01:00,080
Can we get food now?
